**Summary (under 100 words):** No CE code explains the lost REDO. The failing first click and the passing clicks run identical CE work. Nothing in Civil, Structural, Manager or the shared library changes the drawing on a plain-line click. AutoCAD's own first-click handling is the leading suspect, unproven. Draft PR #1829 adds four robot-only settings, all off by default: three skip Civil's after-U work, one logs what anyone does between U and REDO. Full Civil test run: 0 failed. No fix branch. Not tried in AutoCAD.
